    "Description": "Typed letter to the Friends of the Merry-Go-Round from Cy Farley with the Raleigh Fine Arts Society, Inc., dated to February 28, 1977. The letter talks about the Pullen Park Carousel and its need for restoration and ends with a call for help/request for funds to the Merry-Go-Round Restoration. The letter is two pages total (a-b). Signed by Cy Farley on the bottom of the second page. The first page has a letterhead that reads: \"Merry-Go-Round Restoration, P.O. Box 19515, Raleigh, North Carolina 27609.\"",
